@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam margin 8

start
:Create session and load roster;
:Check camera and map pitch;
:Check team colours and player IDs;
:Fit wearables and pair each device;
if (All required checks pass?) then (yes)
  :Start session clock;
  fork
    :Update player and ball tracks;
  fork again
    :Wearable sends raw batches to relay;
    :Read relay stream and check sensor quality;
  end fork
  :Align time, join player data, add quality;
  :Update dashboard and event timeline;
  :Save any identity or event correction;
  :Close session and export checked data;
else (no)
  :Show failed check and fix it;
endif
stop
@enduml
